# Routes

Defined in `src/main.tsx`. Auth guard (`requireAuth` loader) redirects unauthenticated users to `/auth/login`. Super-admin guard (inline loader) redirects non-super-admins to `/dashboard/employees`.

## Public

Layout: `src/layouts/AuthLayout.tsx`

| Path | Component |
|---|---|
| `/` | `src/pages/HomeView.tsx` |
| `/auth/login` | `src/pages/auth/Login.tsx` |
| `/auth/forgot-password` | `src/pages/auth/ForgotPassword.tsx` |
| `/auth/reset-password` | `src/pages/auth/ResetPassword.tsx` |

> `/auth/callback` — not yet implemented

